  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You are a descendent of Liefen families, reflected in your pointed ears, smooth features and limber figure, and your familial history is tinged with woodland magics. When you would be confused, frightened or stupefied for at least 2 rounds, reduce its duration by 1. You also gain immunity against effects that would force you to fall unconsciousness through sleep (but not unconsciousness through other means).</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special:</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> If you are using the Golarion Ancestries rule, you can select any Elf ancestry feats (at your GM’s discretion).</span></p>"
